{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to your first day at the Town Hall.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mayor and her team are delighted to meet their new secretary \u2014 and they\u2019ve prepared more than paperwork for you! Get ready to explore, solve puzzles, and uncover the mysteries hidden behind the walls of the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/ffcf9be41922093dee7ac8e03bea621d.poster.avif?t=1760384524\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/ffcf9be41922093dee7ac8e03bea621d.webm?t=1760384524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/ffcf9be41922093dee7ac8e03bea621d.mp4?t=1760384524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mayor\u2019s Secretary: Escape Game</strong> is a puzzle and exploration game for both <strong>Virtual Reality</strong> and <strong>PC (non-VR)</strong>.<br>Search every room, investigate clues, and experience a fully immersive story \u2014 alone or with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/847c118c3229836a6756a99da03d348d.poster.avif?t=1760384524\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/847c118c3229836a6756a99da03d348d.webm?t=1760384524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/847c118c3229836a6756a99da03d348d.mp4?t=1760384524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0<strong> Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 A detailed town hall with <strong>6 rooms full of puzzles</strong> to explore and solve.<br>\u25a0 <strong>Engaging mechanics</strong> and interactive objects.<br>\u25a0 <strong>Multiplayer</strong> mode \u2014 up to <strong>4 players</strong>.<br>\u25a0 An <strong>immersive story</strong> with hidden secrets.<br>\u25a0 <strong>Save system</strong> to pause your adventure anytime.<br>\u25a0 <strong>Hint system</strong> if you ever get stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/83a30bd920b6f9e636dc3b854a62c329.poster.avif?t=1760384524\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/83a30bd920b6f9e636dc3b854a62c329.webm?t=1760384524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/83a30bd920b6f9e636dc3b854a62c329.mp4?t=1760384524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f VR and Non-VR Support</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR:</strong> Supports full room-scale or standing play on HTC Vive, Oculus Rift, and SteamVR headsets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-VR:</strong> Designed to give PC players a <strong>similar immersive experience</strong>, even without a headset.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/94099dee011563c1ff78edd01c4eb133.poster.avif?t=1760384524\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/94099dee011563c1ff78edd01c4eb133.webm?t=1760384524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/94099dee011563c1ff78edd01c4eb133.mp4?t=1760384524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think you can handle the job?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mayor is counting on you \u2014 and the city is watching\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/a9f2ce4436a86511ec8647ab0168e243.avif?t=1760384524\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598470?t=1760384524","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/53fbdc02e96bf277bf0348e56e81ad66a834e4c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760384524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/4fff5e9aa55e45aca8b1042bcc96c981443450e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760384524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/4fff5e9aa55e45aca8b1042bcc96c981443450e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760384524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_desc